[It is but] a mixture of false dreams, and we are not learned in the interpretation of dreams.\"","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"12:45","t":"But the one who was freed and remembered after a time said, \"I will inform you of its interpretation, so send me forth.\"","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"12:46","t":"[He said], \"Joseph, O man of truth, explain to us about seven fat cows eaten by seven [that were] lean, and seven green spikes [of grain] and others [that were] dry - that I may return to the people [i.e., the king and his court]; perhaps they will know [about you].\"","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"12:47","t":"[Joseph] said, \"You will plant for seven years consecutively; and what you harvest leave in its spikes, except a little from which you will eat.","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"12:48","t":"Then will come after that seven difficult [years] which will consume what you advanced [i.e., saved] for them, except a little from which you will store.","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"12:49","t":"Then will come after that a year in which the people will be given rain and in which they will press [olives and grapes].\"","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"12:50","t":"And the king said, \"Bring him to me.\" But when the messenger came to him, [Joseph] said, \"Return to your master and ask him what is the case of the women who cut their hands. Indeed, my Lord is Knowing of their plan.\"","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"12:51","t":"Said [the king to the women], \"What was your condition when you sought to seduce Joseph?\" They said, \"Perfect is Allāh! We know about him no evil.\" The wife of al-ʿAzeez said, \"Now the truth has become evident. It was I who sought to seduce him, and indeed, he is of the truthful.","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":51,"sd":null},{"k":"12:52","t":"That is so he [i.e., al-ʿAzeez] will know that I did not betray him in [his] absence and that Allāh does not guide the plan of betrayers.","j":12,"h":24,"s":12,"a":52,"sd":null}],"juz":12,"hizb":24,"surahs":[12],"sajdah":false}